id: hello_world
category: basics
difficulty: 1
libs:
checker: exact
timeout: 10
--- prompt
Write an Objeck program that prints exactly this line to standard output:

Hello, Objeck!
--- expected
Hello, Objeck!
--- reference
class Hello {
	function : Main(args : String[]) ~ Nil {
		"Hello, Objeck!"->PrintLine();
	}
}
